WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.100
- But first I wanna talk
about the movie Encanto

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:05.640
because, well, it's all
we watch at my house.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.990
My kids will not let me watch
anything else at this point.

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:09.230
I've seen it so many times.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:10.063
I love it though.

00:00:10.063 --> 00:00:13.610
That's what's helpful is when
people make movies for adults

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.880
and children at the
same time, it's awesome.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:16.860
But there's another woman

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.940
who's become obsessed
with the film as well

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:20.430
after seeing how much she looks

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:22.560
like one of the main characters, Luisa.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:27.560
So this is Luisa and this
is 23-year-old, Maribel.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:29.655
(audience claps)

00:00:29.655 --> 00:00:32.343
I was like, what?

00:00:32.343 --> 00:00:34.470
That is amazing.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:36.970
I was like the guy drawing her, see her

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.400
like it was, it was crazy.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.340
But if you know the movie,

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:41.799
you know why it's also funny
that her real name is Maribel.

00:00:41.799 --> 00:00:45.472
And I do know why, 'cause
I've seen it a lot.

00:00:45.472 --> 00:00:47.840
It's really good though every time.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:50.190
When Maribel discovered
the striking similarities,

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:53.163
she got creative and
posted this to TikTok.

00:00:53.163 --> 00:00:55.615
♪ I don't ask how hard the work is ♪

00:00:55.615 --> 00:00:57.924
♪ Got a rough and
destructive the surface ♪

00:00:57.924 --> 00:00:59.147
♪ Diamonds and platinum. ♪

00:00:59.147 --> 00:01:00.298
♪ I find 'em, I flatten 'em ♪

00:01:00.298 --> 00:01:01.532
♪ I take what I'm handed ♪

00:01:01.532 --> 00:01:02.764
♪ I break what's demanded ♪

00:01:02.764 --> 00:01:05.711
(audience cheers)
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:05.711 --> 00:01:07.922
- We have Maribel dialed in from Phoenix.

00:01:07.922 --> 00:01:09.783
What's up, Maribel?

00:01:09.783 --> 00:01:13.350
(audience cheers)

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:16.030
Oh my gosh, the resemblance is uncanny.

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:18.310
I loved you acting it
out, doing the whole song.

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:20.510
By the way, that's like
my kid's favorite song

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.920
and they like Bruno, We
Don't Talk About Bruno,

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:24.400
but they love that song too, Pressure.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:25.860
But how did you put it together?

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:28.520
Did you see it or did
someone tell you about it?

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:31.600
- Well, people started commenting
that I looked like Luisa,

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.470
so I was like, wow.

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:36.360
And I was like, they're like
have you watched Encanto?

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:38.410
Have you seen the video?

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:40.360
And I was like, no, I haven't.

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.290
And so I was like, okay,
so I watched the movie

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:45.053
and I started getting comments,

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:47.533
like I watched the movie

00:01:47.533 --> 00:01:50.170
and I was like, oh my goodness,
I see the resemblance.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:52.890
And so, not only did I
not see the resemblance

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:55.050
but I've never seen a Disney
character look like me.

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:56.850
So, I was just so excited.

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:59.380
And it's crazy because in the movie

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:02.320
she carried the whole
world on her shoulders

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:04.710
and in this same place,
I felt the same way

00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:07.510
'cause growing up, I
had to raise my siblings

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:08.530
from the age of six

00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:11.480
'cause my mom had mental
health issues, so.

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:14.280
And then when I got older I adopted them.

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:17.870
So now I was like, wow,
I need to do this video.

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:20.670
- That's crazy how much you
can relate to the message.

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.520
That's amazing.

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:25.470
And you actually heard
from Luisa herself, right?

00:02:25.470 --> 00:02:26.360
- Yes.

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:28.740
Jessica Darrow actually

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:32.050
she commented on my video and liked it.

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:34.340
And then, I ended up messaging her

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:35.810
and I was like I would love to meet you.

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:36.970
And she's like likewise.

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:39.550
And I was so excited.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:40.760
- I love that.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.100
Well, she did a fantastic job

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.810
and you did a fantastic job on TikTok.

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:45.043
Thank so much, Maribel.

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:47.373
God bless.

